SUMMARY:Ali Wong Live LIVE at Arlene Schnitzer Concert Hall (Saturday Show)
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nAli Wong is an Emmy Award-winning actress\, comedian\, writer\, and producer who has become one of the most celebrated voices in stand-up comedy. Born and raised in San Francisco\, Ali broke through with her wildly popular Netflix specials Baby Cobra (2016) and Hard Knock Wife (2018)\, both filmed while she was visibly pregnant — a bold and hilarious choice that became her signature. \nHer fourth Netflix special\, Ali Wong: Single Lady (2024)\, earned her a Golden Globe Award and a Critics Choice TV Award nomination. She also starred in and executive produced the acclaimed Netflix/A24 dark comedy series Beef (2023)\, for which she won the Emmy\, Golden Globe\, Critics Choice\, and Screen Actors Guild Awards for Best Actress in a Limited Series. \nAli’s comedy is raw\, confessional\, and unapologetically honest — covering topics from relationships and family life to identity and ambition with a fearless comedic voice that resonates deeply with audiences worldwide. \nEvent Details\nDate: Saturday\, August 8\, 2026 \nTime: 7:00 PM (Doors open 1 hour before showtime) \nVenue: Arlene Schnitzer Concert Hall — 1037 SW Broadway Ave\, Portland\, OR 97205 \nTicket Limit: 6 tickets per household \nNote: This is Show 2 of 2 Portland performances. A first show takes place on August 7\, 2026. This second show was added due to popular demand! \nAbout the Venue\nThe Arlene Schnitzer Concert Hall — lovingly called “The Schnitz” by Portlanders — is one of the Pacific Northwest’s most treasured performance spaces. Situated in the heart of downtown Portland at 1037 SW Broadway Ave\, this magnificent 2\,776-seat venue is part of the Portland’5 Centers for the Arts complex. \nOriginally constructed in 1928 as the Portland Public Theatre\, the hall was meticulously restored and reopened in 1984. Its stunning Italian Baroque architecture\, ornate interior details\, and world-class acoustics create an unforgettable atmosphere for live performances. Every seat in the house offers excellent sightlines to the stage. \nThe venue features orchestra\, mezzanine\, and balcony seating levels\, along with a full bar\, concessions\, and accessible seating options. Parking is available in nearby downtown Portland garages\, and the venue is conveniently accessible via TriMet public transit. Phone: 503-248-4335. \nWhat to Expect\nAli Wong Live is a full evening of stand-up comedy featuring Ali’s signature confessional and boundary-pushing humor. Based on recent tour reviews\, the show runs approximately 60–75 minutes including an opening act. \nExpect Ali at her most personal and hilarious — sharing stories from her life post-divorce\, her experiences as a working mother\, and her unique perspective on modern relationships and identity. Her comedy is sharp\, relatable\, and delivered with incredible energy and timing. \nThe Saturday show was added due to overwhelming demand for the Friday performance — a testament to Ali Wong’s massive popularity with Portland audiences. The Arlene Schnitzer Concert Hall provides an intimate and elegant setting\, with exceptional acoustics and a warm atmosphere that makes every seat feel close to the action. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: From $120 (resale prices may vary) \nThis second Portland show was added due to popular demand — don’t miss your chance to see Ali Wong live! \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/ali-wong-live-at-arlene-schnitzer-concert-hall-saturday/
LOCATION:Arlene Schnitzer Concert Hall\, 1037 SW Broadway Ave\, Portland\, Oregon\, 97205\, United States Of America
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://comedycalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/e03b01e0-2f00-4b0e-be33-7c89a92f3253_RETINA_PORTRAIT_3_2-LYSGrH.jpg
GEO:45.516856;-122.6811861
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Arlene Schnitzer Concert Hall 1037 SW Broadway Ave Portland Oregon 97205 United States Of America;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=1037 SW Broadway Ave:geo:-122.6811861,45.516856
END:VEVENT
