SUMMARY:Kill Tony LIVE at Madison Square Garden (Night 2)
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets \nResale Tickets \nKill Tony LIVE at Madison Square Garden (Night 2)\nKill Tony returns to Madison Square Garden for Night 2 on Saturday\, August 8\, 2026! Hosted by Tony Hinchcliffe\, this is a completely separate show from Night 1 with its own unique lineup of comedians and celebrity guests. Each night of Kill Tony at MSG is a standalone event — don’t miss either night of this historic two-night run at The World’s Most Famous Arena. \nEvent Details\nDate: Saturday\, August 8\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM\nVenue: Madison Square Garden\nAddress: 4 Pennsylvania Plaza\, New York\, NY 10001\nCapacity: ~20\,000\nParking: Available at MSG parking facilities and nearby garages\nAge Requirement: All ages (18+ recommended for content) \nAbout Kill Tony\nKill Tony is a weekly live podcast hosted by comedian Tony Hinchcliffe\, featuring unknown comedians performing 60-second stand-up sets judged by Tony and rotating celebrity guests. The show has grown from a small Austin club to selling out the world’s biggest arenas\, including two consecutive nights at Madison Square Garden. Each taping is completely unique\, making every show a must-see experience. \nWhat to Expect\n\nTony Hinchcliffe hosting a live taping of the Kill Tony podcast\nA brand-new lineup of unknown comedians and celebrity guests (different from Night 1)\n60-second stand-up sets with live feedback and crowd interaction\nUnfiltered\, raw comedy in front of a massive MSG crowd\nAn electric Saturday night atmosphere at The Garden\nA completely unique show — no two Kill Tony nights are the same\n\nVenue Information\nMadison Square Garden\, located at 4 Pennsylvania Plaza in Midtown Manhattan\, is the most famous arena in the world\, hosting over 300 events per year. With a capacity of approximately 20\,000\, MSG offers world-class amenities\, multiple food and beverage options\, and easy access via Penn Station and multiple subway lines. \nTicket Information\nOfficial tickets start at $605 and are available through Ticketmaster. Resale tickets are also available through VividSeats. Night 2 tickets are sold separately from Night 1. Secure your seats now — this show is expected to sell out! \nOfficial Tickets \nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/kill-tony-live-at-madison-square-garden-night-two/
