SUMMARY:Please Don't Destroy: Live LIVE at The Pageant
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets\n\nAbout Please Don’t Destroy\nPlease Don’t Destroy is the beloved comedy trio of Ben Marshall\, John Higgins\, and Martin Herlihy — three best friends who rose to fame through their viral sketch comedy videos on Saturday Night Live. \nKnown for their absurdist humor\, deadpan delivery\, and brilliantly crafted sketches\, Please Don’t Destroy have become one of the most exciting live comedy acts touring today. Their chemistry is undeniable\, and their live shows bring a whole new energy to the material fans already love. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Saturday\, August 8\, 2026\nDoors: 6:00 PM | Show: 7:00 PM\nVenue: The Pageant\, 6161 Delmar Blvd\, Saint Louis\, MO 63112\nAges: All Ages\nTicket Prices: Starting at $27.00\n\nAbout The Pageant\nThe Pageant is one of St. Louis’s premier live entertainment venues\, located in the vibrant Delmar Loop neighborhood. With a capacity of approximately 2\,500\, it offers an intimate yet energetic atmosphere that makes every show feel special. \nThe venue features excellent sightlines from nearly every spot on the floor\, a full bar\, and a dedicated balcony section for those who prefer a more relaxed viewing experience. The Pageant is known for its top-notch sound system and welcoming vibe\, making it a favorite for both performers and fans alike. \nParking is available in nearby lots and street parking along Delmar Blvd. The venue is also accessible via MetroLink at the Delmar Loop station. \nWhat to Expect\nPlease Don’t Destroy: Live is a full-length sketch comedy show featuring original material\, fan-favorite bits\, and plenty of surprises. The trio brings their signature brand of weird\, wonderful humor to the stage in a format that goes beyond what you’ve seen on SNL. \nExpect audience interaction\, live music elements\, and the kind of spontaneous energy that only comes from seeing these guys perform in person. Whether you’re a longtime fan or discovering them for the first time\, this show promises an unforgettable night of laughter. \nTicket Information\nTickets for Please Don’t Destroy: Live at The Pageant start at $27.00. Secure your seats now before they sell out! \n\nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/please-dont-destroy-live-at-the-pageant/
LOCATION:The Pageant\, 6161 Delmar\, Saint Louis\, MO\, 63112\, United States Of America
