SUMMARY:Daniel Sloss: BITTER LIVE at The Wilbur (Night 2)
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nDaniel Sloss: BITTER LIVE at The Wilbur (Night 2)\nScottish stand-up sensation Daniel Sloss returns to Boston’s iconic Wilbur Theatre for a second night with his brand-new show BITTER on Saturday\, August 8\, 2026. Following the massive success of his Netflix specials\, Sloss is back with his darkest\, funniest material yet. \nEvent Details\nDate: Saturday\, August 8\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM ET\nVenue: The Wilbur\nAddress: 246 Tremont St.\, Boston\, MA 02116\nAge Requirement: All Ages\nParking: Discounted parking at 660 Washington St. Garage \nAbout Daniel Sloss\nDaniel Sloss is a Scottish comedian who has taken the world by storm with his Netflix specials Dark and Jigsaw\, which have been credited with inspiring thousands of breakups worldwide. His comedy is brutally honest\, deeply personal\, and laugh-out-loud funny. BITTER is his most anticipated new show yet. \nWhat to Expect\n\nDaniel Sloss’s brand-new stand-up show: BITTER\nDark\, intelligent humor with emotional depth\nOne of the most talked-about comedians in the world\nAn intimate evening at Boston’s beloved Wilbur Theatre\nA second chance to catch this sold-out sensation\n\nVenue Information\nThe Wilbur is one of Boston’s most beloved comedy and entertainment venues\, located at 246 Tremont St. in the heart of the city’s Theatre District. It offers an intimate atmosphere with excellent acoustics and sightlines. \nTicket Information\nTickets start from $90. Don’t miss your chance to see Daniel Sloss live — Night 1 sold out fast! \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you.\nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/daniel-sloss-bitter-live-at-the-wilbur-night-two/
