SUMMARY:Jessica Kirson LIVE at Sound Waves at Hard Rock Hotel & Casino Atlantic City
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nJessica Kirson LIVE at Sound Waves at Hard Rock Hotel & Casino Atlantic City\nGet ready for a night of non-stop laughter as the incomparable Jessica Kirson takes the stage at Sound Waves at Hard Rock Hotel & Casino Atlantic City on Saturday\, August 8\, 2026. One of the most dynamic and physically hilarious comedians performing today\, Jessica delivers a high-energy show that leaves audiences in tears — from laughing so hard. \nEvent Details\nDate: Saturday\, August 8\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM (Doors open at 7:00 PM)\nVenue: Sound Waves at Hard Rock Hotel & Casino Atlantic City\nAddress: 1000 Boardwalk\, Atlantic City\, NJ 08401\nAge Requirement: All ages welcome (under 18 must be accompanied by an adult)\nParking: Available at Hard Rock Hotel & Casino Atlantic City \nAbout Jessica Kirson\nJessica Kirson is a powerhouse comedian known for her explosive energy\, fearless crowd work\, and deeply funny character-driven material. She has appeared on The Tonight Show\, Comedy Central\, and released multiple acclaimed specials. A favorite in Atlantic City and beyond\, Jessica consistently delivers one of the most entertaining live comedy experiences anywhere. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHigh-energy\, physically hilarious stand-up comedy from start to finish\nJessica’s signature crowd interaction and improvised moments\nNew material alongside fan-favorite bits\nAn intimate yet electric atmosphere at Sound Waves\nA show that will have you laughing until it hurts\n\nVenue Information\nSound Waves at Hard Rock Hotel & Casino Atlantic City is an intimate\, state-of-the-art entertainment venue located inside the Hard Rock Hotel & Casino at 1000 Boardwalk. With exceptional acoustics and a cozy atmosphere\, it’s the perfect setting for an up-close comedy experience. \nTicket Information\nTickets start at $72. Don’t wait — Jessica Kirson shows in Atlantic City sell out fast. Grab your seats now! \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
