SUMMARY:Jerry Seinfeld LIVE at Acrisure Amphitheater
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout Jerry Seinfeld\nJerry Seinfeld is one of the most iconic comedians in the history of stand-up comedy. Best known as the co-creator and star of the legendary NBC sitcom Seinfeld\, which ran from 1989 to 1998 and is widely considered one of the greatest television shows ever made\, Jerry has never stopped performing live stand-up comedy throughout his entire career. \nHis observational comedy style — finding humor in the mundane details of everyday life — has influenced generations of comedians. From his early days on the New York comedy circuit to his Netflix special 23 Hours to Kill and his film Unfrosted\, Seinfeld remains one of the sharpest and most disciplined comedians working today. \nSeeing Jerry Seinfeld live is a bucket-list comedy experience. This is a rare opportunity to see a true legend of the art form perform in Grand Rapids. \nEvent Details\nDate: Saturday\, August 8\, 2026 \nTime: 8:15 PM \nVenue: Acrisure Amphitheater\, 201 Market Ave SW\, Grand Rapids\, MI 49503 \nAge Restriction: All ages \nTicket Prices: Starting from $100 \nAbout Acrisure Amphitheater\nAcrisure Amphitheater is Grand Rapids’ premier outdoor entertainment venue\, located at 201 Market Ave SW along the Grand River. With a capacity of approximately 12\,000 (including lawn seating)\, it offers a stunning outdoor setting for world-class performances under the summer sky. \nThe venue features reserved pavilion seating\, general admission lawn areas\, multiple food and beverage options\, and beautiful views of the Grand River. Parking is available in nearby downtown structures\, and the venue is easily accessible from downtown Grand Rapids. Summer evenings at Acrisure Amphitheater are truly magical. \nA Jerry Seinfeld show at an outdoor amphitheater on a summer evening in Grand Rapids is an experience you won’t soon forget. \nWhat to Expect\nThis is a solo stand-up comedy show featuring Jerry Seinfeld performing his full headline set. Expect approximately 75–90 minutes of masterfully crafted observational comedy that showcases why Seinfeld is considered one of the all-time greats. \nTickets for this show just went on sale on March 27\, 2026. Demand is expected to be extremely high — secure your seats as soon as possible. Arrive early to enjoy the outdoor venue atmosphere and grab food and drinks before the show begins. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: Starting from $100 (fees may apply) \nSecure your seats through the official Ticketmaster link or find resale tickets through VividSeats for flexible options. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/jerry-seinfeld-live-at-acrisure-amphitheater/
LOCATION:Acrisure Amphitheater\, 201 Market Ave SW\, Grand Rapids\, Michigan\, 49503\, United States
