SUMMARY:Bob the Drag Queen LIVE at Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets\n\nAbout the Performer\nBob the Drag Queen — born Caldwell Tidicue — is one of the most electrifying and multifaceted entertainers in comedy today. Best known for winning the title of “America’s Next Drag Superstar” on Season 8 of RuPaul’s Drag Race\, Bob has since built an empire that spans stand-up comedy\, television\, podcasting\, and literature. \nBob’s comedy is sharp\, unapologetic\, and deeply personal — blending razor-sharp wit with social commentary\, personal storytelling\, and outrageous crowd work. Audiences can expect a high-energy performance that is as hilarious as it is thought-provoking. \nBeyond drag\, Bob has hosted three seasons of HBO’s Peabody Award-winning series We’re Here\, competed as a fan-favorite on Peacock’s The Traitors\, and hosted Madonna’s iconic Celebration World Tour in 2023–2024. Bob’s debut book\, Harriet Tubman: Live in Concert\, became a New York Times Bestseller in May 2025. Bob’s podcast Sibling Rivalry\, co-hosted with drag sister Monét X Change\, is one of America’s top comedy podcasts. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Saturday\, August 8\, 2026\nShow Time: 9:30 PM CDT (Doors open at 9:00 PM)\nVenue: Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club\, 618 NW Loop 410\, San Antonio\, TX 78216\nAge Restriction: 18+ (Valid photo ID required for entry)\nFood & Beverage: 2-item minimum per person once seated\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club is San Antonio’s premier stand-up comedy destination\, conveniently located in Park North Plaza at Loop 410 and Blanco — just inside the loop and only a few miles from San Antonio International Airport. \nThe club features an intimate showroom with a warm\, club-style atmosphere perfect for comedy. Seating is first-come\, first-served by section\, so arriving early is recommended to secure the best spots. The venue offers both Preferred Seating (center stage) and General Admission tables (side stage and wings). \nThe Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club also features a full bar lounge — a great place to grab a drink before the show. The venue is ideal for date nights\, group outings\, birthday parties\, and special events. Note: there is an 18% service charge on all checks in the showroom\, and food and beverage service ends approximately 45 minutes into the show. \nWhat to Expect\nBob the Drag Queen delivers a full stand-up comedy experience that is unlike anything else on the touring circuit. Expect a high-energy\, laugh-out-loud performance filled with personal stories\, sharp social commentary\, and Bob’s signature brand of fearless\, unapologetic humor. \nThis is a late-night show (9:30 PM)\, so expect an energetic crowd and a performer at the top of their game. Bob has headlined multiple theater-level stand-up comedy tours and brings that same big-stage energy to the intimate setting of the Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club. \nWhether you’re a longtime fan of RuPaul’s Drag Race or simply love great stand-up comedy\, this show promises to be a memorable night out in San Antonio. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $37.58 – $49.94 (includes fees) \n\nPreferred Individual Ticket: $40 + fees = $49.94\nGA Individual Ticket: $30 + fees = $37.58\n\nTickets are available through official Ticketmaster/TicketWeb channels and resale platforms. All sales are final — no refunds or exchanges. \n\nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/bob-the-drag-queen-live-at-laugh-out-loud-comedy-club/
LOCATION:Laugh Out Loud Comedy Club\, 618 Northwest Loop 410\, San Antonio\, TX\, 78216\, USA
