SUMMARY:Daniel Sloss: BITTER LIVE at The Wilbur (Matinee)
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nDaniel Sloss is one of Scotland’s most celebrated stand-up comedians\, known for his razor-sharp wit\, dark humor\, and deeply personal storytelling. He first gained international attention with his Netflix specials Dark and Jigsaw\, the latter of which became famous for reportedly causing thousands of breakups worldwide after audiences reconsidered their relationships. \nNow Sloss is back with his brand-new tour\, BITTER — a show that dives headfirst into love\, loss\, and the messy aftermath of both. Expect the same unflinching honesty and comedic brilliance that has made him one of the most talked-about comedians of his generation. His style blends laugh-out-loud moments with genuine emotional depth\, leaving audiences both in stitches and in their feelings. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Sunday\, August 9\, 2026\nTime: 3:00 PM (Matinee Show)\nVenue: The Wilbur\, 246 Tremont St\, Boston\, MA 02116\nDoors Open: Approximately 2:00 PM\nAge Restriction: 18+ recommended (adult content)\nTicket Prices: From $68 (avg. ~$147)\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe Wilbur is one of Boston’s most iconic and beloved comedy venues\, located in the heart of the Theatre District at 246 Tremont Street. Built in 1914\, this stunning 1\,200-seat theater combines historic elegance with modern amenities\, offering an intimate yet grand atmosphere perfect for stand-up comedy. \nThe venue features excellent sightlines from every seat\, a full bar\, and a warm\, energetic atmosphere that makes every show feel special. Whether you’re in the orchestra\, mezzanine\, or balcony\, you’ll feel close to the action. Parking is available at nearby garages\, and the venue is easily accessible via the MBTA Green and Orange Lines (Boylston and Back Bay stations). \nWhat to Expect\nThis is a rare Sunday matinee performance of Daniel Sloss’s BITTER tour — a perfect afternoon outing for comedy fans who want to experience one of the world’s best stand-up comedians in an intimate Boston setting. The show runs approximately 90 minutes with no intermission. \nSloss performs solo\, commanding the stage with his signature blend of dark comedy and personal narrative. Fans of his Netflix specials will find BITTER to be his most mature and emotionally resonant work yet. Come prepared to laugh hard\, think deeply\, and leave with a new perspective on relationships and life. \nTicket Information\nTicket Prices: From $68 (average ~$147) \nSecure your seats through official Ticketmaster channels or find resale tickets through VividSeats: \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/daniel-sloss-bitter-live-at-the-wilbur-matinee/
LOCATION:The Wilbur\, 246 Tremont St.\, Boston\, MA\, 2116
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://media.ticketmaster.com/en-us/dam/a/cfa/e476394e-b2ce-4a11-8230-879e15686cfa_TABLET_LANDSCAPE_LARGE_16_9.jpg
