DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nVincent Bryant LIVE at Punch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento\nStand-up comedian Vincent Bryant is coming to Punch Line Comedy Club in Sacramento on August 9\, 2026! Known for his high-energy performances and hilarious takes on everyday life\, Vincent Bryant delivers a comedy show that will have you laughing from start to finish. \nEvent Details\nDate: Sunday\, August 9\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM (Doors open at 6:00 PM)\nVenue: Punch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento\nAddress: 2100 Arden Way\, Sacramento\, CA 95825\nAge Requirement: 18+ with valid government-issued photo ID\nBeverage Minimum: 2 beverages per person \nAbout Vincent Bryant\nVincent Bryant is a dynamic stand-up comedian who has built a strong following through his relatable humor and energetic stage presence. With a style that blends sharp observations with personal storytelling\, Vincent has become a fan favorite on the comedy circuit\, performing at clubs and festivals across the country. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHigh-energy stand-up comedy performance\nRelatable humor and personal storytelling\nSharp observational comedy\nIntimate club atmosphere at Sacramento’s premier comedy venue\nFull bar service with 2-beverage minimum\n\nVenue Information\nPunch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento is located at 2100 Arden Way in Sacramento\, CA. One of the top comedy clubs in Northern California\, it features a full bar\, great sightlines\, and ample free parking in the shopping center lot. \nTicket Information\nTickets start from $37. This is an 18+ event with a 2-beverage minimum per person. Tickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) or VividSeats (resale). \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.
